=== KMS controls (single temperature) ===

KMS T=1: w = [1.0, 2.0], T = [1.0, 1.0], beta_i*w_i = [1.0, 2.0]
   single-copy ergotropy W_1 = 0.000e+00  -> PASSIVE
   W_N / N, N = 1..: 0.000e+00 0.000e+00 -7.401e-17 0.000e+00 1.776e-16 0.000e+00 -6.344e-17 0.000e+00 0.000e+00
   asymptotic per-copy limit E - E(gibbs at equal entropy) = -2.2204e-16  (beta* = 1.0000)

KMS T=0.3, three modes: w = [0.5, 1.0, 1.7], T = [0.3, 0.3, 0.3], beta_i*w_i = [1.6667, 3.3333, 5.6667]
   single-copy ergotropy W_1 = -1.388e-17  -> PASSIVE
   W_N / N, N = 1..: -1.388e-17 1.388e-17 1.850e-17 1.388e-17 0.000e+00 3.701e-17
   asymptotic per-copy limit E - E(gibbs at equal entropy) = 2.0817e-16  (beta* = 3.3333)

ground state (T=0, beta=inf): w = [1.0, 2.0], T = [0, 0], beta_i*w_i = [inf, inf]
   single-copy ergotropy W_1 = 0.000e+00  -> PASSIVE
   W_N / N, N = 1..: 0.000e+00 0.000e+00 0.000e+00 0.000e+00 0.000e+00 0.000e+00 0.000e+00 0.000e+00 0.000e+00
   asymptotic per-copy limit E - E(gibbs at equal entropy) = 0.0000e+00  (beta* = 10000.0000)

