   single-copy ergotropy W_1 = 0.000e+00  -> PASSIVE
   W_N / N, N = 1..: 0.000e+00 0.000e+00 1.607e-03 3.300e-03 4.806e-03 5.408e-03 6.156e-03 6.630e-03 7.044e-03
